# Keep text files LF in every checkout, whatever core.autocrlf is on the machine
# doing the checkout. Added after a CI failure caused by the opposite: a Windows
# checkout had CRLF in the working tree while the committed blob was LF, and a
# harness that hashed working-tree bytes passed locally and failed in CI.
#
# No renormalisation: every tracked text file is already LF in the index.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly binary — never convert.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
